{"kind": "mod", "id": 1745, "name": "Discarder", "slug": "discarder", "teaser": "Multi-select discard for UI Fixes", "owner_name": "Tyfon", "downloads": 14337, "favourites": 26, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.tyfon.discarder", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-09T18:02:47.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-09-23T17:35:44.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-09-23T17:35:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1", "latest_version": "5.0.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Requires <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1342/ui-fixes\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">UI Fixes</a>! You must have UI Fixes installed for this mod to do anything.</h3>\n<p>Adds the ability to discard multiple items at once, in and out of raid, when multi-selecting items with UI Fixes. You must have UI Fixes installed and the multi-select feature enabled (which it is by default)</p>\n<p>This is a separate mod from UI Fixes because:</p>\n<p>1. I wanted a proof of concept for the mulit-select interop</p>\n<p>2. Force you to opt-in to a feature that could delete half your stash if you use it that way.</p>\n<p>No configuration required. You will still get a single confirmation dialog when discarding items out of raid.</p>\n<p>If you install this mod and use it to delete items, then complain that it deleted items, you have no one to blame but yourself.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Like almost every mod here, extract the zip archive into your SPT directory.</p>\n<p>Example (thanks DrakiaXYZ for the gif)</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vKRw58b.gif\" alt=\"vKRw58b.gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Uninstallation</h3>\n<p>To uninstall, simply delete <strong>Tyfon.Discarder.dll</strong> from <strong>&lt;your SPT folder&gt;/BepInEx/plugins</strong></p></div></div></div>\n<p>If you’d like to support my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/tyfon\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">buy me a coffee</a> ☕</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "2.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.10.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2475, "published_at": "2024-11-26T19:44:13.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1745/discarder/2.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "3.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 3712, "published_at": "2025-03-16T04:05:45.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1745/discarder/3.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "4.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.0.0", "content_length": 5724, "downloads": 6137, "published_at": "2025-10-17T08:56:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1745/discarder/4.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": [{"id": 1342, "name": "UI Fixes", "slug": "ui-fixes", "status": "ok"}]}, {"version": "5.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1", "content_length": 6027, "downloads": 316, "published_at": "2026-08-09T16:26:00.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1745/discarder/5.0.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "compatible", "dependencies": [{"id": 1342, "name": "UI Fixes", "slug": "